  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c2a67ba2-d228-4981-b68f-23f3e3517273.png\" width=\"863\" height=\"222\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>需要安装以下所有模组：</strong></span></em></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a> <span style=\"color:#eccafa\">(<a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sbom_xela\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>sbom_xela</span></a>)</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_05b0c02b-7784-46c4-a51f-e6c21d926b22.png\"></a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a> <span style=\"color:#eccafa\">(<a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/obliviousspartan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>ObliviousSpartan</span></a>)</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_39a19969-bfdd-4510-9eeb-e03924491215.png\"></a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-ice-and-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: Ice and Fire</a> <span style=\"color:#eccafa\">(<a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kreloxcz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>kreloxcz</span></a>)</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-ice-and-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_084eb33d-f354-484d-8003-c210a787bb0e.png\"></a></span><br></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>本模组为<strong>Spartan Weaponry</strong>和<strong>Ice and Fire&nbsp;</strong>添加了多种实用物品与功能，略微扩展并调整了它们的内容与兼容性！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h4><br><strong>本模组目前<em>新增</em>了以下内容：</strong><br>龙骨重型弩箭 + 药水效果变体</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c0a2829f-47ab-4c45-bcfb-b7ed7cc7d6d5.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h4><br><strong>本模组目前<em>修改</em>了以下内容：<br></strong></h4>\n<h4>火龙骨 + 龙钢技能</h4>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9d4d929b-89f2-44e7-8854-a11937436fd3.gif\" width=\"465\" height=\"240\"></h4>\n<h4><br>雷龙骨 + 龙钢技能</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_76ff2537-ca29-4c87-9252-591798eb0134.gif\" width=\"465\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p>这些功能可在<strong>spartanfireextras-common.toml</strong>配置文件中自定义设置！<br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br><em>未来可能的计划：<br>- 冰/火/雷龙骨箭矢<br>- 冰/火/雷龙骨弩箭<br>- 冰/火/雷龙钢箭矢<br>- 冰/火/雷龙钢弩箭</em><br>- 斯廷法洛斯怪鸟弩箭<br>- 两栖龙弩箭<br>- 潮汐弩箭<br>- 九头蛇弩箭<br><br></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
